@startuml lms_act_context_swimlane
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1A56DB
  FontColor #1E293B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DiamondBorderColor #1A56DB
  DiamondFontColor #1E293B
}

skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #1A56DB
  BorderThickness 2
  TitleFontSize 13
  TitleFontStyle bold
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #1E293B
  FontColor #1E293B
  FontSize 11
}

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' Context Activity Diagram (Swimlane) — Student Enrollment Process
' Learning Management System | Group 07 — CS13477
'
' Mirrors SD06a slide 16 in scope: ONE bounded cross-system business
' process showing where the LMS plugs into the wider university
' workflow alongside its three external collaborators.
'
' Each swimlane = one «system» from the C4 L1 (LMS, University SIS,
' Authentication System, Email & Notification Service).
'
' Actions are business-process verbs at organisational granularity —
' no UI clicks, no validation, no DB writes.
'
' Control flow uses decisions and merges; the post-confirmation
' side-effects (update roster / notify student / sync to SIS) are
' shown as sequential cross-lane flow rather than a fork bar,
' because PlantUML's swimlane engine cannot reliably render fork
' bars across multiple lanes. Each branch terminates at its own
' stop node to avoid auto-merge artifacts.
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

title <b>Context Activity Diagram (Swimlane) – Student Enrollment Process</b>\nGroup 07 · Learning Management System

|SIS| «system» University SIS
start
:Publish Approved\nStudent Records;

|Auth| «system» Authentication System
:Provision Student\nIdentity (SSO);

|LMS| «system» Learning Management System
:Initiate Enrollment\nfor Course Offering;

if (Enrollment Source?) then ([SIS sync])
  |SIS|
  :Send Student Roster;
  |LMS|
  :Import Roster;
else ([manual])
  :Receive Manual\nEnrollment Request;
endif

if (Seat Available?) then ([yes])
  :Confirm Enrollment;
  :Update Course\nRoster;

  |Email| «system» Email & Notification Service
  :Notify Student of\nEnrollment Confirmation;

  |SIS|
  :Sync Enrollment\nRecord;
  stop

else ([no])
  |LMS|
  :Add Student\nto Waitlist;

  |Email|
  :Notify Student of\nWaitlist Status;
  stop
endif

@enduml